title Home Assistant: long names and a room of 300 entities (cut with dots, values whole), scrolled by Page Down
sizes 480x320 640x480 800x480 1024x600 1280x720 1280x800 720x720 480x800 480x640 800x1280
env HA_DEMO big

wait 1000
shot big-home
check big-home
key end
key up
key up
key enter
wait 1500
shot big-room
check big-room
key pgdn
key pgdn
key pgdn
wait 500
shot big-room-scrolled
check big-room-scrolled
expect noquit
